Id: avir001w
Severity: WARN
Category: intrusion
Check: check_antivirus
Fix: Run freshclam and leave its updater enabled.
References: freshclam(1); freshclam.conf(5)
Controls: CIS 10.1; NIST SI-3; ISO 8.7; CE Malware protection

ClamAV is installed but its signatures are missing, or every one
of them is older than a week: freshclam never fetched any, or
stopped fetching, so it scans with nothing to match, or with
yesterday's knowledge. Run freshclam, and leave its timer or
daemon enabled so they stay fresh.
